---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Selected by Men is an independent recommendation site. We publish honest product guides, comparisons, and Amazon picks."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">
      The short version
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-6xl">
      We are here to help you buy less, better.
    </h1>
    <div class="prose prose-article mt-10 max-w-none prose-lg">
      <p>
        The internet is full of “best of” lists that read like they were written
        by a spreadsheet. Selected by Men exists for a different reader: a man
        who wants a short, honest answer — and who would rather own one
        excellent thing than five forgettable ones.
      </p>
      <p>
        We cover grooming, style, tech, fitness, home, and everyday carry. The
        tone is practical. The bar is high. If a product does not survive daily
        use, it does not survive the edit.
      </p>

      <h2>How we choose</h2>
      <p>Every recommendation has to clear the same filter:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Is the design considered, or just loud?</li>
        <li>Will it still feel right in a year?</li>
        <li>Is the price honest for the materials and construction?</li>
        <li>Do verified owners report the same strengths we care about?</li>
        <li>Would we tell a friend to buy it?</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not accept payment for placement. Brands cannot buy a ranking.
        When we get something wrong, we update the guide.
      </p>

      <h2>About the links</h2>
      <p>
        Product links go to Amazon product pages. We keep the lists short
        because a bloated roundup is a worse reading experience and a worse
        recommendation.
      </p>
      <p>
        Prices, stock, and shipping times change. Always check the retailer
        page before you buy.
      </p>

      <h2>Who this is for</h2>
      <p>
        Men who already have taste, or who want to build it without turning
        shopping into a hobby. You do not need another 40-tab research session.
        You need a point of view.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
